ries in written communication"}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-engl-ink-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-engl-care-600","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Public versus private communication, and how easily the line moves"}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-engl-ink-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-engl-care-600","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Digital communication risks — forwarding, screenshots, and shared screens"}]]}]]}]]}]
16:["$","section",null,{"id":"grammar","className":"scroll-mt-32 border-t border-engl-ink-200 pt-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-5","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-2 flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-engl-ink-800 text-sm font-bold text-white","aria-hidden":"true","children":3}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-bold text-engl-ink-900 sm:text-3xl","children":"Grammar Focus"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"max-w-[68ch] leading-relaxed text-engl-ink-600","children":"A small set of high-value grammar skills, tied directly to this topic's communication task."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-engl-ink-200 bg-white p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-3 font-display text-lg font-bold text-engl-ink-900","children":"Clarity and precision"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-2","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-engl-ink-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-engl-ink-400","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Vague pronouns that leave the reader guessing who is meant"}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-engl-ink-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-engl-ink-400","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Ambiguous wording that could describe two different situations"}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-engl-ink-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-engl-ink-400","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Pronoun–noun agreement"}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-engl-ink-700","children":[["$","sp